### Create a city (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cities
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"name": "Bengaluru", "state": "Karnataka"}

> {% client.global.set("cityId", response.body.id); %}

### Rename it
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cities/{{cityId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN

{"name": "Bangalore", "state": "Karnataka", "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata"}

### List active cities (customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cities
X-User-Id: 5b1e3f60-0000-4000-8000-00000000c001
X-User-Role: CUSTOMER

### Deactivate it (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cities/{{cityId}}/deactivate
X-User-Id: 0f8d7c1a-0000-4000-8000-00000000a001
X-User-Role: ADMIN
